Subject: [PATCH] Production forecast from the weather forecast

- card 'Prognoza produkcji': expected kWh today and tomorrow for the roof
  (SolarEdge) and the terrace (Hoymiles) from Open-Meteo global tilted
  irradiance for each roof's tilt and direction, production so far vs.
  forecast so far, expected power right now from the current weather
- dashed forecast curve on today's power chart
- warning when a roof gives much less than expected under a clear sky
  (shading, dirt, inverter) or after snowfall in frost (snow on the panels)
- roof settings (kWp, tilt, direction) saved on the device:
  GET/POST /api/fusion/prefs

